                                                "sense_id": "07356856-1006-37fa-8e02-900fb2deb5b0",
                                                "text": "After all, hospitality is natural to man. Amid the ten thousand pamperings that attend upon wealth, it is forgotten, because we have not need for it; but it is only suspended, and the moment it is necessary, it revives."
